command-set-entity-xeno-ally-status = 设置所提供实体的蜂巢盟友状态。
command-set-entity-xeno-ally-status-help = 用法：sethiveally <ent> <hive entity> <true/false>

command-set-faction-xeno-ally-status = 设置所提供派系的蜂巢盟友状态。
command-set-faction-xeno-ally-status-help = 用法：sethivefactionally <NpcFactionPrototype id> <hive entity> <true/false>

command-clear-xeno-ally-ents = 移除所有与蜂巢结盟的实体（不包括派系）的蜂巢盟友状态。
command-clear-xeno-ally-ents-help = 用法：clearhiveallies <hive entity>